{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/panduan-cloudflare/layout,_N_T_/panduan-cloudflare/page,_N_T_/panduan-cloudflare"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/panduan-cloudflare/__PAGE__","/panduan-cloudflare","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"id\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0xcqtl8zgi9kw.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/15xrurgzs99gv.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0dgq26a5_oy.a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/07lhk_q6pmm3r.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02g3221oh~3le.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-05poq_ye6dti6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/097hmhzx-h3zn.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Panduan Pasang di Cloudflare | TikTookSaver</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tutorial bergambar langkah demi langkah untuk mengunduh, menjalankan, dan memasang website TikTookSaver di Cloudflare Workers.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"TikTookSaver,unduh video TikTok,TikTok downloader,simpan video TikTok,TikTok MP4\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"TikTookSaver — Momen favoritmu, selalu dekat\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Cara praktis menyimpan video dan audio TikTok favorit dari tautan publik.\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TikTookSaver — Momen favoritmu, selalu dekat\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Cara praktis menyimpan video dan audio TikTok favorit dari tautan publik.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container header-inner\"><a class=\"logo\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"logo-symbol\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></span><span>tiktook<span class=\"logo-accent\">saver</span><span class=\"logo-dot\">.</span></span></a><a class=\"header-cta\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg> Kembali ke Beranda</a></div></header><section class=\"guide-hero\"><div class=\"container guide-hero-inner\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-spark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg></span> PANDUAN UNTUK PEMULA</span><h1>Website-mu online<br/><span>dengan Cloudflare.</span></h1><p>Mulai dari mengunduh file proyek hingga website tampil online. Ikuti setiap langkah bergambar ini — tidak perlu pengalaman coding sebelumnya.</p><div class=\"guide-actions\"><a href=\"/tiktooksaver-source.zip\" download=\"\" class=\"primary-action\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg> Unduh file proyek (.zip)</a><a href=\"#langkah-1\" class=\"secondary-action\">Mulai tutorial <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check lucide-verified\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> Gratis untuk mulai</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-laptop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.526a2 2 0 0 0 .212.897l1.068 2.127a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45l1.068-2.127A2 2 0 0 0 4 15.526V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M20.054 15.987H3.946\"></path></svg> Windows / macOS / Linux</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z\"></path></svg> 7 langkah bergambar</span></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-body\"><div class=\"container guide-layout\"><aside class=\"guide-sidebar\"><b>DAFTAR LANGKAH</b><a href=\"#langkah-1\"><span>01</span>Unduh file proyek</a><a href=\"#langkah-2\"><span>02</span>Siapkan Node.js</a><a href=\"#langkah-3\"><span>03</span>Buat akun Cloudflare</a><a href=\"#langkah-4\"><span>04</span>Jalankan di komputer</a><a href=\"#langkah-5\"><span>05</span>Login Cloudflare</a><a href=\"#langkah-6\"><span>06</span>Publikasikan website</a><a href=\"#langkah-7\"><span>07</span>Hubungkan domain</a><a class=\"side-download\" href=\"/tiktooksaver-source.zip\" download=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg> Unduh proyek ZIP</a></aside><div class=\"guide-content\"><div class=\"guide-intro\"><h2>👋 Sebelum mulai</h2><p>Proyek ini adalah aplikasi Next.js yang disiapkan untuk <strong>Cloudflare Workers</strong> menggunakan adaptor OpenNext. Unduh file ZIP, ekstrak, lalu ikuti langkah di bawah secara berurutan. Hosting dasar bisa dimulai di paket gratis Cloudflare; batas penggunaan mengikuti ketentuan Cloudflare.</p><p><strong>Catatan:</strong> Fitur unduh video memakai layanan pihak ketiga TikWM. Layanan tersebut bisa berubah, membatasi akses, atau tidak mendukung video tertentu. Gunakan hanya untuk konten yang berhak Anda simpan.</p></div><section class=\"guide-part\" id=\"langkah-1\"><div class=\"guide-part-heading\"><span class=\"guide-number\">01</span><div><h2>Unduh &amp; ekstrak file proyek</h2><p>Semua file website sudah disiapkan dalam satu paket ZIP.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-visual\"><div class=\"mock-files guide-visual-inner\"><div class=\"mock-files-title\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-archive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.659 22H18a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2.4 2.4 0 0 0-.706-1.706l-3.588-3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 0 14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11.5\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M8 12v-1\"></path><path d=\"M8 18v-2\"></path><path d=\"M8 7V6\"></path><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> tiktooksaver-source.zip</div><div class=\"mock-file-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 20a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.69-.9L9.6 3.9A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2Z\"></path></svg> src / app / ...</div><div class=\"mock-file-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code-corner lucide-file-code-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12.15V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.706.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-3.35\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m5 16-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m9 22 3-3-3-3\"></path></svg> package.json</div><div class=\"mock-file-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code-corner lucide-file-code-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12.15V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.706.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-3.35\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m5 16-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m9 22 3-3-3-3\"></path></svg> wrangler.jsonc</div><div class=\"mock-file-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code-corner lucide-file-code-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12.15V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.706.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-3.35\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m5 16-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m9 22 3-3-3-3\"></path></svg> README.md</div></div></div><div class=\"guide-instructions\"><ol><li>Klik tombol <strong>Unduh file proyek (.zip)</strong> di bagian atas halaman.</li><li>Cari file <code>tiktooksaver-source.zip</code> di folder Downloads komputer Anda.</li><li>Klik kanan file dan pilih <strong>Extract All / Ekstrak Semua</strong> (Windows) atau klik dua kali (Mac).</li><li>Masuk ke folder hasil ekstrak <code>tiktooksaver</code>. Folder ini berisi semua kode website.</li></ol><div class=\"guide-note\">💡 Simpan folder hasil ekstrak di tempat yang mudah ditemukan, misalnya Desktop.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-part\" id=\"langkah-2\"><div class=\"guide-part-heading\"><span class=\"guide-number\">02</span><div><h2>Pasang Node.js di komputer</h2><p>Node.js menjalankan perintah proyek di komputer Anda.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-visual\"><div class=\"mock-browser guide-visual-inner\"><div class=\"mock-browser-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"mock-browser-url\">nodejs.org</span></div><div class=\"mock-browser-content\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#3b714a;margin-bottom:15px\">⬢ node.js <span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#8a8990;font-weight:400\">Download</span></div><div class=\"mock-line long\"></div><div class=\"mock-line\"></div><span class=\"mock-orange-btn\" style=\"background:#4b985c;margin-top:6px\">Download Node.js (LTS)</span></div></div></div><div class=\"guide-instructions\"><ol><li>Buka <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nodejs.org/en/download</a>.</li><li>Unduh versi <strong>LTS</strong> (disarankan Node.js 20 atau lebih baru), lalu jalankan installer seperti aplikasi biasa.</li><li>Buka <strong>Terminal</strong> (Mac/Linux) atau <strong>PowerShell</strong> (Windows). Ketik perintah berikut untuk memeriksa pemasangan:</li></ol><pre class=\"code-block\">node -v<!-- -->\n<!-- -->npm -v</pre><div class=\"guide-note\">💡 Jika muncul nomor versi seperti v22.x.x, Node.js sudah terpasang. Jika belum, tutup dan buka kembali Terminal.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-part\" id=\"langkah-3\"><div class=\"guide-part-heading\"><span class=\"guide-number\">03</span><div><h2>Buat akun Cloudflare gratis</h2><p>Akun Cloudflare diperlukan untuk menerbitkan website.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-visual\"><div class=\"mock-browser guide-visual-inner\"><div class=\"mock-browser-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"mock-browser-url\">dash.cloudflare.com</span></div><div class=\"mock-browser-content\"><div class=\"mock-cloudflare\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f48b3e\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg> cloudflare</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px\">Welcome to Cloudflare</div><div class=\"mock-line long\"></div><div class=\"mock-line\"></div><span class=\"mock-orange-btn\">Sign up for free →</span></div></div></div><div class=\"guide-instructions\"><ol><li>Buka <a href=\"https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up</a> dan pilih <strong>Sign up</strong>.</li><li>Masukkan alamat email dan buat kata sandi, lalu selesaikan verifikasi email.</li><li>Setelah masuk, biarkan tab dashboard Cloudflare tetap terbuka.</li></ol><div class=\"guide-note\">💡 Belum punya domain? Tidak masalah. Anda akan mendapat alamat gratis dengan akhiran <code>.workers.dev</code>.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-part\" id=\"langkah-4\"><div class=\"guide-part-heading\"><span class=\"guide-number\">04</span><div><h2>Jalankan website di komputer</h2><p>Cek tampilannya secara lokal sebelum dipublikasikan.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-visual\"><div class=\"mock-terminal guide-visual-inner\"><div class=\"mock-terminal-top\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Terminal</span></div><div class=\"mock-terminal-body\"><div class=\"cmd\">~/Desktop/tiktooksaver $ npm install</div><div class=\"dim\">added packages...</div><div class=\"cmd\">~/Desktop/tiktooksaver $ npm run dev</div><div class=\"mock-green-check\">✓ Ready at http://localhost:3000</div></div></div></div><div class=\"guide-instructions\"><ol><li>Buka Terminal / PowerShell di folder <code>tiktooksaver</code>. Di Windows, buka folder di File Explorer, klik bilah alamat, ketik <code>powershell</code>, lalu tekan Enter. Di Mac, buka Terminal lalu ketik <code>cd </code> dan seret folder ke jendela Terminal.</li><li>Jalankan perintah di bawah satu per satu:</li></ol><pre class=\"code-block\">npm install<!-- -->\n<!-- -->npm run dev</pre><ol start=\"3\"><li>Buka <a href=\"http://localhost:3000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://localhost:3000</a> di browser. Jika tampilan TikTookSaver muncul, berarti berhasil. Tekan <code>Ctrl + C</code> di Terminal untuk menghentikan server lokal.</li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-part\" id=\"langkah-5\"><div class=\"guide-part-heading\"><span class=\"guide-number\">05</span><div><h2>Hubungkan komputer ke Cloudflare</h2><p>Login sekali melalui browser, lalu terminal siap menerbitkan proyek.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-visual\"><div class=\"mock-terminal guide-visual-inner\"><div class=\"mock-terminal-top\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Terminal</span></div><div class=\"mock-terminal-body\"><div class=\"cmd\">$ npx wrangler login</div><div class=\"dim\">Opening a link in your default browser...</div><div class=\"dim\">Allow Wrangler to access your account</div><div class=\"mock-green-check\">✓ Successfully logged in</div></div></div></div><div class=\"guide-instructions\"><ol><li>Pastikan Terminal masih berada di folder proyek <code>tiktooksaver</code>.</li><li>Jalankan perintah berikut:</li></ol><pre class=\"code-block\">npx wrangler login</pre><ol start=\"3\"><li>Browser akan terbuka. Pilih akun Cloudflare Anda dan klik <strong>Allow / Izinkan</strong>.</li><li>Kembali ke Terminal. Jika muncul <strong>Successfully logged in</strong>, lanjut ke langkah berikutnya.</li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-part\" id=\"langkah-6\"><div class=\"guide-part-heading\"><span class=\"guide-number\">06</span><div><h2>Publikasikan ke Cloudflare Workers</h2><p>Satu perintah untuk membangun dan mengunggah website Anda.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-visual\"><div class=\"mock-success guide-visual-inner\"><div class=\"mock-success-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div><b>Website is live!</b><p>Deployment successful</p><span class=\"mock-success-link\">tiktooksaver.nama-anda.workers.dev ↗</span></div></div><div class=\"guide-instructions\"><ol><li>Di Terminal, jalankan perintah berikut dari folder proyek:</li></ol><pre class=\"code-block\">npm run deploy</pre><ol start=\"2\"><li>Proses pertama mungkin memerlukan beberapa menit. Jika diminta membuat subdomain Workers, pilih <strong>Yes</strong> dan tentukan nama yang tersedia.</li><li>Setelah selesai, cari alamat <code>https://tiktooksaver.nama-akun.workers.dev</code> di Terminal. Buka alamat tersebut untuk melihat website yang sudah online.</li><li>Untuk memperbarui website nantinya, ubah file yang diinginkan lalu jalankan <code>npm run deploy</code> lagi.</li></ol><div class=\"guide-note warning\">⚠️ Jangan pakai <code>npx wrangler deploy</code> langsung untuk proyek ini. Perintah <code>npm run deploy</code> membangun aplikasi Next.js terlebih dahulu.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"guide-part\" id=\"langkah-7\"><div class=\"guide-part-heading\"><span class=\"guide-number\">07</span><div><h2>Hubungkan domain sendiri (opsional)</h2><p>Gunakan nama domain pribadi agar website makin profesional.</p></div></div><div class=\"guide-card\"><div class=\"guide-visual\"><div class=\"mock-browser guide-visual-inner\"><div class=\"mock-browser-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"mock-browser-url\">dash.cloudflare.com/workers-and-pages</span></div><div class=\"mock-browser-content\"><div class=\"mock-cloudflare\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f48b3e\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg> Workers &amp; Pages</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px\">tiktooksaver <span style=\"color:#28ae79\">● Active</span></div><div class=\"mock-line long\"></div><span class=\"mock-orange-btn\">+ Add Custom Domain</span></div></div></div><div class=\"guide-instructions\"><ol><li>Tambahkan domain Anda ke akun Cloudflare dan pastikan nameserver sudah diarahkan ke Cloudflare.</li><li>Di dashboard buka <strong>Workers &amp; Pages → tiktooksaver → Settings → Domains &amp; Routes</strong>.</li><li>Pilih <strong>Add → Custom Domain</strong>, masukkan domain/subdomain, lalu ikuti konfirmasi pada layar.</li><li>Tunggu DNS dan sertifikat HTTPS aktif. Website tetap bisa diakses lewat alamat <code>.workers.dev</code> selama menunggu.</li></ol><div class=\"guide-note\">💡 Domain kustom tidak wajib. Anda bisa memakai alamat gratis <code>.workers.dev</code> selama yang Anda butuhkan.</div></div></div></section><div class=\"guide-final\"><h2>Siap meluncurkan website-mu? 🚀</h2><p>File sudah siap, panduan sudah lengkap. Mulai dari langkah pertama dan sebentar lagi TikTookSaver milikmu tayang online.</p><a href=\"/tiktooksaver-source.zip\" download=\"\" class=\"primary-action\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg> Unduh proyek sekarang</a></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-bottom\" style=\"border-top:0;padding-top:0\"><span>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> TikTookSaver. Dibuat untuk memudahkan langkah pertamamu.</span><a href=\"/\">← Kembali ke beranda</a></div></div></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\